items.toString:
Steps to reproduce:
1. build/unpack
2. remove/comment out http-upgrade element in management-interfaces/http-interface

# boot via bin/domain.sh









There are two parts to this.
1.

It seems that http-upgrade element is required ( given that it contains sasl-authentication-factory at least) in management-interface definition, however xsd:

